	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Molex 5025700893 microSD memory card connector, 1.10 mm pitch, normal-mount SMT, push-push, front card entry, shielded, with independent mechanical card-detect switch. PRIMARY GEOMETRY: Molex sales drawing SD-502570-001 Rev A, archived in vendor/Molex_5025700893/ - contact pitch 1.1, contact land width 0.8, 8-contact centre span 7.7, shell lands 1.4 x 1.7, and the 14.3 dimension which is OUTER-EDGE TO OUTER-EDGE across the two bottom shell mounts (12.900 centre-to-centre + 1.400 = 14.300 exactly). The 4.45 datum is to the FIRST CONTACT CENTRE. SECONDARY CORROBORATION: exact-part EasyEDA/JLCPCB CAD C429846 (Manufacturer MOLEX, MPN 5025700893), which reproduces every readable Molex dimension - pitch 1.1000, span 7.7000, land 0.800, shell 1.400 x 1.700, detect land 1.150 - and supplied the pad numbering. PAD 9 IS REPEATED ON FOUR PHYSICAL SHELL LANDS (EH/shield): two bottom mounts 1.4 x 1.7 and two top mounts 1.5 x 1.15. That is deliberate and valid - the symbol has ONE logical pin 9. Do not renumber them. Pad 10 is DET-SW, pad 11 is the DETECT LEVER which Molex labels Vss:GROUND. MECHANICAL CARD DETECT: closed to GND on card insertion, open with no card. CARD ENTRY IS -Y, THE CONTACT-TAIL EDGE (D-805 correction: Molex SD-502570-001 sheet 1 draws the card and its push 0.7 / lock 1.7 / eject 5.7 mm positions beyond the tail-row edge; the D-804 text said +Y). Classification VERIFIED_VENDOR_DRAWING_WITH_EXACT_PART_CAD_CORROBORATION.")
	(tags "Molex 5025700893 microSD card connector push-push card-detect shielded")
